# Planning documents. Working notes for the repo owner, not part of the plugin.
# Verified untracked: none of these is in the index, and no commit in any ref has
# ever touched AURELIUM-FIXPLAN.md or PLAN.md (`git ls-files`, `git log --all --
# <path>`). An earlier note here claimed AURELIUM-FIXPLAN.md was still tracked and
# shipped to every clone; that was wrong, and there is nothing to untrack.
AURELIUM-FIXPLAN.md
PLAN.md
# Agent routing notes for this repo. They point at the fixplan above, so they stay
# local alongside it.
AGENTS.md

